OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 11 JAN
OL,4,G0900FRadio 3's American Roadtrip
OL,5,     GPetroc Trelawny explores the
OL,6,     Gmusic of North Texas, with guests
OL,7,     Gincluding conductor Robert Spano
OL,8,     Gand composer Quinn Mason, and
OL,9,     Glive music from Orpheus Chamber
OL,10,     GSingers.
OL,11,G1200FPrivate Passions
OL,12,     GMichael Berkeley's guest is the
OL,13,     Gsinger, actor and Broadway star
OL,14,     GVanessa Williams, whose musical
OL,15,     Gpassions include Bach, Copland,
OL,16,     GBernstein and Jennifer Higdon.
OL,17,G1330FMusic Map
OL,18,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch takes us on a
OL,19,     Gmusical journey with a Czech
OL,20,     Gflavour as she goes in search of
OL,21,     GDvorak's evergreen Scherzo
OL,22,     GCapriccioso.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
