OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 11 JAN
OL,4,G1800FWords and Music
OL,5,     GRhashan Stone and Caitlin
OL,6,     GFitzgerald read from prose and
OL,7,     Gpoetry conveying a sense of
OL,8,     Gfreedom in America, alongside
OL,9,     Gmusic by Copland, Florence Price,
OL,10,     GMiles Davis, Jessie Montgomery.
OL,11,G1915FSunday Feature: New Music New York
OL,12,     GAgainst a backdrop of financial
OL,13,     Gcrisis and disinvestment in New
OL,14,     GYork City, New Music was born.
OL,15,     GWriter Richard King explores the
OL,16,     Gconditions for creativity in New
OL,17,     GYork in the 1970s.
