OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 11 JAN
OL,4,G2000FSchumann and Bernstein
OL,5,     GContinuing BBC Radio 3's
OL,6,     Gcelebration of American music,
OL,7,     Ghere are two less-well known
OL,8,     Gpieces from the States - William
OL,9,     GSchuman's Fifth Symphony and
OL,10,     GLeonard Bernstein's Songfest.
OL,11,G2100F20th Century Radicals
OL,12,     GKate Molleson and Gillian Moore
OL,13,     Gshine new light on the 'modern'
OL,14,     Gmusic of the 20th century. This
OL,15,     Gweek, Kate explores the
OL,16,     Grevolutionary compositions of US
OL,17,     Gmaverick, Henry Cowell.
